Exp 2c:Largest of the three numbers

Aim:
To write a Java program to find the largest among three numbers.

Algorithm:
1. Start the program.
2. Import the Scanner package.
3. Read three numbers from the user.
4. Compare the three numbers using if-else statements.
5. Find and display the largest number.
6. Stop the program.

Program:
import java.util.Scanner;
public class LargestOfThree {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);

        int a, b, c;

        System.out.print("Enter three numbers: ");
        a = sc.nextInt();
        b = sc.nextInt();
        c = sc.nextInt();

        if (a >= b && a >= c) {
            System.out.println("Largest number = " + a);
        } else if (b >= a && b >= c) {
            System.out.println("Largest number = " + b);
        } else {
            System.out.println("Largest number = " + c);
        }

        sc.close();
    }
}

Output:
Enter three numbers: 25 60 40
Largest number = 60

Result:
Thus, the Java program to find the largest of three numbers was executed successfully.
